{"asset_key":"ep8/quest_story_18260470","episode":"ep8","category":"quest_story","story_id":"18260470","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1826047001:1":{"text":"I hadn't expected you to buckle so quickly... You really are spineless.","source_cn":"没想到你竟然这么快就求饶了，真是……没有骨气啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x017FECA5B1DFC9EB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1826047002:1":{"text":"Now, shall we play a little game?","source_cn":"不如这样，我们来做一个游戏如何？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7D6E9143AB901C2B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1826047003:1":{"text":"Answer my questions correctly, and you'll be rewarded. If you get them wrong... you'll suffer.","source_cn":"如果你能答对，我就给你奖励。但要是你答错了……我也只能...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3534EBCB96E690E5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1826047004:1":{"text":"I-I don't want anything! Please... just let me go!","source_cn":"我……我不要奖励！只求求……求求您放过我！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB852060346B5624B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1826047005:1":{"text":"That's not for you to decide.","source_cn":"那可不是你说了算的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x76D6538A44128D8E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1826047006:1":{"text":"Tell me... How long has it been since Lady Tephesia, that insufferable little vampire, last showed her face?","source_cn":"我问你，你们的领主……那个恶劣的小吸血鬼，有多久没出现了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCCB201093439D11C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1826047007:1":{"text":"I-I may hold a noble title, but I've never had the privilege of meeting Her Lady—","source_cn":"我……我只是个小贵族，根本接触不到领主阁——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x710FD38FA734DC57","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1826047008:1":{"text":"<shk>Ow!!!</shk>","source_cn":"<shk>——啊！！！</shk>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x319478B3A62DF551","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1826047009:1":{"text":"My, what a piercing scream. Look around you. So many of your friends are waiting their turn. Think carefully, and don't waste my time with useless answers.","source_cn":"虽然我很享受你的尖叫，但看看周围——还有这么多人在等待...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x29F71A7A2F95624F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1826047010:1":{"text":"F-Fine! I-I'll talk!","source_cn":"我、我说……我说！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC03A0CEEEC014ECD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1826047011:1":{"text":"I think... Her Ladyship's never been seen since the lockdown began and the theater suspended its shows!","source_cn":"是从……从戒严以后，海歌剧院演出暂停……领主阁下就再也...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x90FE351E0EF0D109","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1826047012:1":{"text":"B-But when the explosion happened on Crescent Street, someone claimed to have seen her there... gravely injured...","source_cn":"不、不过，月弯街发生爆炸的时候……有人说在街上看到了她...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4DCE03962005AA3B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1826047013:1":{"text":"I-I'm not sure if it's true! I didn't see her with my own eyes...","source_cn":"但是……但是我不知道那是不是真的，我没有亲眼见到……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDCC8C5D48BE743A5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1826047014:1":{"text":"That's... a fine answer!","source_cn":"嗯……这个问题你答得不错，我很满意。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x50D59295D6BDA4E5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1826047015:1":{"text":"Hmm... How should I reward your effort...","source_cn":"让我想想，该奖励你什么才好呢……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x398AD5D23E37D5EC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1826047016:1":{"text":"Please... I want to go home!","source_cn":"求您……求您饶了我吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x338AC6A1B0E8FE9B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1826047017:1":{"text":"Go home? Oh, where's the fun in that?","source_cn":"饶了你？多么无趣的提议啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x290028C1E3AA222A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1826047018:1":{"text":"Ah, here's an idea. I'll give you... the chance to answer one more question!","source_cn":"啊，我想到了。你的奖励是……再回答我一个问题。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBB710351A680A8A4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1826047019:1":{"text":"Baba Muriel, the physician from the Repair House... Where is she now?","source_cn":"修缮屋的医师——那个穆婆婆，她去哪了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7418284EC148C2CA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1826047020:1":{"text":"I-I haven't the faintest idea! She's vanished!","source_cn":"我、我不知道！她失踪了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFED6F2978B8CBCD6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1826047021:1":{"text":"All I know is that Bantus is after her for sabotaging a military base, and her wanted posters are plastered all over Novaris... The army even imposed a lockdown to catch her. We're too scared to leave our homes...","source_cn":"班题斯说她破坏了军事基地，城里到处都是通缉令……军队为...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x75AA43A6B011349A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1826047022:1":{"text":"M-Maybe... the Bantus army has already captured her! Y-Yes, that could explain why she's been missing for so long!","source_cn":"说不定……说不定她已经被军队抓走了！对，对……她消失了...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7B174E38FBC9DEB9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1826047023:1":{"text":"Captured by the Bantus army? Heh heh...","source_cn":"被班题斯军队抓走了？呵呵……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x37904B4EA6F296DA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1826047024:1":{"text":"Since you're so certain, stop struggling and take your punishment!","source_cn":"既然你这么信誓旦旦，那就别再挣扎了。乖乖受罚吧——！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA3A8CCC04332B9E8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1826047025:1":{"text":"<shk>Please... don't!!! Agh...</shk>","source_cn":"<shk>不……不要！！啊——！</shk>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAB9404357E9DB22D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:斯莱泽":{"text":"Salazer","source":"斯莱泽","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:贵族昆廷":{"text":"Sir Quentin","source":"贵族昆廷","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":26,"localized_text_count":25,"speaker_count":2}}